OL,3,GNEWSAWoman sentenced for breaching
OL,4,Aanonymity order in Jeffrey Donaldson
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who breached the anonymity of
OL,8,Fone of the victims of child sex
OL,9,Foffender Jeffrey Donaldson has been
OL,10,Fsentenced to three months in prison.
OL,12,FDonna Toman, from Lord Moira Park in
OL,13,FBallynahinch, previously pleaded guilty
OL,14,Fto the charge of breaching a lifetime
OL,15,Fban on reporting.
OL,17,FThe 55-year-old was charged after she
OL,18,Fposted on social media.
